      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b3f665/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-14T17:17:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The \"battleship\" style location system Is an option for fixed maps (using rows and columns, ie A01 to B03). That way you only have letters and numbers on the outside of the map. However, that wouldn't work for the tiles. I am open to ideas for sure.&nbsp;</p>",
