      "created_at": "2014-04-14T17:26:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Number every hex, letter every tile.</p><p>Tile A has hexes numbered 1-12, Tile B also has 1-12. You start on A2, move to A3 and then move on to B12.</p><p>It also makes building maps easier. A is next to B, C is directly under B with C10 at the top</p>",
